<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition.</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Ephesia</para>
  <para style="toc1">EPHESIA Mi-ngaidiang Paul Chemajia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ephesia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eph</para>
  <para style="mt1">EPHESIA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mi-ngaidiang Paul Chemajia</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Ephesia mi-ngaidiang Paul chemajia hi </char> Colossia mi ngaidiang chemajia khale apha in-angrip-ah Jisu Christa inneisuo kum soomruk thengnga Paul in ileimajia eii. Kamajiapa hi Paul kei ka-eii tiya amalar (1:1). Colossia larik ah Paul apumtak in donna chong imajia ngaikha Ephesia larik hin insam om-innum kasing kathei katam in Paul imajia eii tiya inzootna innei. Paul imajia larik ejarra Ephesia ramsuungnga kaom koisuok katamlangdiang hiwa larik mintungsik hi ajar eii. Hiwa larik majia laikhan Paul hi mikhumna ah kaom tiya aril (3:1, 4:1, 6:20). Paul in hiwa larik hi Tychicus diang Ephesus koisuok kapha sik-ah ajuona lamma ajuominchoi (6:21-22).</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Ephesus</char> hi kalokthei khuopui kha alei-eii halli Asia Minor ramsuungnga kaom Rome ngai khuopuilai kha-um alei-eii. Ephesus hi Greek ngai Pathian juornu Artemis biak-inn omjarra araming kasi khuopui kha alei-eii (Chuon 13:23-31). Ephesus koisuok hi inphutna achu arajung kacheet koisuok kha inlei-eii takkha ahekna achu in-or koisuok kha injuo-eii (Chonglar 2:1-7).</para>
  <para style="ip">Hiwa larik inphutna makheiya alai katunghin, Pathian in ama mi ngaihi angtho tholi Jisu Christa diang sanminringna apeme tijarra Paul in inthiarra rilcheenna anei. Paul in koisuok hi taksa pum eii halli Christa hi taksa lu kha eii khat-um koisuok hi inhongsak inn kha eii halli Christa hi lukchi miliya inhongsak inn kasur lungpui kha eii tiya minkhina anei. Larik lai makheiya ahekna katung khan Paul in christian ringkhuo khat-um nunchan jarra minchuna anei.</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paul in apumtak jarra inrilsuok le inruoiya Ephesia mi ngaikha donna anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Hiwa thengnga Paul in koisuok hi Christa le injom eti jarra aril <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1:3–3:21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Hiwa thengnga paul in christian ringkhuo jarra aril <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4:1–6:20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Insuona chong <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Pathian lungdou nuoiya Christa Jisu tirton ka eii Paul kei'n,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Ephesia ah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat achu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ephesia ah </char><char style="ft" closed="false">itihi majiamu.</char></note> kaom inthiang Pathian mi ngai khat-um Christa Jisu diang huoikajou ah akaom ngaidiang: <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Chuon 18:19-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:1">19:1</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Nipa Pathian khat-um Pumi Jisu Christa diangnga inphut riangwai khat-um akahoi kadai kha nangnidiang omrase.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa diangnga inphut Ratha lamtiang Rawaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Pathian khat-um eini Pumi Jisu Christa Pa ka eii, marwaanna inphut ratha lamma angrakip Christa diangnga inphut rawaan kanapeii ama kha minpaakrui. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Ajarchu ama'n manmasituol aboolmaklai amadiang inthiang khat-um kachok omlekleiya ama maikuungnga ami ka-esik ah eini inakadang kha ni-ejei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Minriang jarra <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Pathian in ama imanuom khat-um alungdou nuoiya, Jisu Christa diangnga inphut ama sangai enasik-ah, eini inakadang kha ni-ejei. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Iminriangkhet Asapa diangnga inphut alurna riangwai kha aman kaboiya einidiang anapeii jarra, eini'n Pathian kha minpaakrui.<verse eid="EPH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Ajarchu Christa thisen khan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Christa thisen khan; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Christa in inphanna ithi khan.</char></note> eini inakatan kha eii khachu, eini manu ngaikha inara-ngaidam kha eii. Pathian riangwai kha angtuk akalokme, <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Col 1:14</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />ama'n einidiang hituk kalok ah inapehi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Ama lungsing lungwar khat-um ajetna pumpuiya <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />inphuumma kaom ama lungdoukha Christa diang i-ngaidon dungjuiya einidiang anaminjetjei. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Apha kha huui hongtung nikhan Pathian in amintungsik khachu, marwaan khat-um nuoipilla kaom ang rakip ngaihi Christa nuoiya inomwiaksik eii.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Ang rakip Pathian i-ngaidon khat-um lungdou nuoiya kasuok kha eii; ama lungdou dungjuiya Christa diang ami enasik-ah Pathian in eini nakadangjei, hiwahi inphutna makheiya ama imanuom dungjuiya eii. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Christa diang ngamna kaneimasa eini ngaihi ama lurna lianna minpaakrui.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Chong kadik khat-um sanminringna chongpui kajetjei, halli amadiang ngamna kaneijei nangni-um amadiang chong inkhitna kha Ratha Inthiang diang jetnabi inadeeng kha ning-ejei. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Eini in nichangsik kasuok kha nichangmak laiseng Ratha Inthiang khan sakhi eya na-ngirpi, khawa jarra ama lurna lianna kha minpaakrui.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Minpaakna khat-um Pathian diang Nina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Nangni in Pumi Jisu ningngamna khat-um Pathian kajet mi rakip ngaikha ningminriang itihi kajetniya inphut, hiwa jarra, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />kei'n nangni sik-ah inchat lekleiya Pathian kaminpaak khat-um Pathian diang kananipi. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Ajarchu nangni'n ama kha kheella ningjet nasik-ah, Pumi Jisu Christa Pathian ka eii, kalurkhet Pa Pathian in lungsing lungwaar khat-um kamalar mator ratha kha nangnidiang napenasik kei'n inchat lekleiya Pathian diang kani. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Ningmalungnga inthiangnga ama'n nangni anakoina jarkha ningjet matornasik, khat-um Pathian kajet ngai changsik hi hituk kalok eii itihi munasik a-um kei'n Pathian diang kani, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />halli ama ka-ngamnajei eini chungnga ama chuonthohi angtuk kalokme. Khawa ranak kha<verse eid="EPH 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />inliingna ah Christa kha akathi makheiya aminring khat-um marwaanna akut changtiang amin-ong. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Minpkla 110:1</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Christa in marwaan na kaom waikaroon ngai, chuon karoon ngai, ranak ngai, reng ngai chungnga wai aroonjei, halli tuunna khangnga bit emak-ah akahongsik khangnga raming inthang rakip chungnga ama raming in wai roonjei.<verse eid="EPH 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Halli Pathian in ang rakip ngaihi Christa kenuoiya adajei halli koisuok sik-ah ama kha ang rakip ngai chungnga wai aminroonjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Minpkla 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:18">Col 1:18</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Koisuok hi Christa taksapum eii, ang rakip chungnga apum tak-in asipna ama puitungna kha eii.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ang rakip chungnga apum tak-in asipna; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ama chungnga Pathian puitungna khan asip.</char></note><verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Christa diang Ringna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Apha matiangchu nangni chong ningjuimak khat-um ningmanu jarra ratha lamtiang ningleithi kha eii. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Khawa laikhan nangni'n manmasituol kadikmak lamkha ningleijui khat-um lairalak rengramma waikaroonpa, Pathian kajuimakngai chungnga chuonkatho ratha nukkha ningjui <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Hiwangai karra eini rakip-um nipum khat-um nimalung imanuomkha nijuiya taksa lamma niringnga nileiom, khawa jarra eini um mi rakip le in-angnga, Pathian raangna nuoiya kaom sangai nilei eii.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Takkha minriang kalok Pathian in, ama minriangna kha eini chungnga alok jarra, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />eini'n nimanu roonna nileithiya nileiom innum, ama'n Christa le inruoiya anaminring. Riangwai jarra nangni ringna ningmu kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 2:13">Col 2:13</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Halli Pathian in Christa le inruoiya eini anaminring khat-um Christa Jisu diang niomjarra ama'n marwaan ramma amale inruoiya wai naminroon, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />hiwahi akahongsik pha rakip-ah minkhidan kaboi ama minriangna riangwai kha Christa diang anaminmu nasik eii. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Ajarchu riangwai jarra ngamna khan nangni ringna ningmu kha eii; halli hiwahi nangni ithokha emak, takkha Pathian kutchoi kha eii, <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />tuteii innum in-or ommak nasik, chuontho jarra emak. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Ajarchu eini ngaihi ama kutbool ni eii, Pathian in eini thosik-ah ileibool suojei chuon katha kathosik-ah Christa Jisu diangnga inabool kha ni eii.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa diang Inkhatbit ni eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Inpum tak-in wunkatan kin-eii kati (taksa-ah wun intan) inmani'n nangni naneiya inphut wunkatanmak Zaatlop ning eii natikha ngaidonru. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Khawa phakhan Christa diang leiom makchu, Pathian ikadang mi ngai lei-emak chu, Pathian le inzootna khan ram leiilaak mi ning-eii, manmasituolla ngamna khat-um Pathian kajetmak ninglei eii itikha ngaidonru. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Takkha apha khat-ah kalaak-ah kaleiom nangni ngaikha tuunchu Christa Jisu thisen khan Christa diang kanaiya inaheiruoi kha ning ejei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Christa Jisu thisen khan; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Christa in inphanna inathipi khan.</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Inni kaminhalla kaom bangkha makoiya khat-um inni kha inkhatbit kanamin eii, Ama apumtak kha eini sik-ah akadai kha eii.<verse eid="EPH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Ama'n inni kalei eii kha akathar miring inkhat amadiang min enasik-ah ama'n Jihudi ngai chongpe ngaili sinadan ngaikha aminmangnga kahoi kadai inzootna kha abool. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 2:14">Col 2:14</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Cross-ah ithi khan inmani inhalna kha Christa in aminmang, Cross jarra taksa inni kalei ekha taksa inkhatbit amin eya Pathian le aminjomjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Col 1:20</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Halli ama'n aheiwa-ah akahoi akadai kha Pathian diang kalaak-ah akaom inmani diang khat-um kanaiya akaom nangnidiang aril. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Isa 57:19</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Ajarchu Christa diangnga inphut Jihudi khat-um Zaatlop eini in Ratha inkhatbit ah Pa Pathian maikuungnga niheiwa mator.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Khawa jarra nangni chu woikhat inlet-ah khuolmi khat-um zaatlop kha emakchujei, takkha Pathian mi ngai khale inruoiya nirammi khat-um Pathian innsuungkhur mi ning ejei. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Tirton ngaili Pathian chongkachoi ngai'n innmun inleideeng halli inleideeng innmun chungnga insak inn kha nangni ning eii halli akil miliya in-ong lungpui kha Christa Jisu kha eii. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Inn pumpui khan amadiang inchun halli Pumi diang inthiang biak-inn ka-esik ah insak eii. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Halli nangni um Pathian in Ratha-ah i-om Christa diangnga insaksuom inn kha ning ejei.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Zaatlop ngaidiang Paul Chuontho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Hiwa jarra, zaatlop nangni rathuulla Christa Jisu sik-ah mikhumna ah kaom Paul kei'n Pathian diang kani. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Hiwa Pathian riangwai nangni sik-ah thosik chuon keidiang inape kha nangni'n ningjetjei tia kei ka-ngamnajei. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Khachu imphuumma kaom Pathian lungdou kha malarra keidiang anaminjetjei, halli kei'n kabongnga kimajia kha ejei.<verse eid="EPH 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Hiwahi ningteel phakhan kei'n Christa diangnga inphuumma kaom kajet nakha nangni'n jetningte. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Apha matiangchu hiwa inphuumma kaomhi manmasi ngaidiang ileiminjet emak, takkha tuunchu Ratha-ah Pathian in ama tirton khat-um Pathian chongkachoi ngaidiang iminjetkha ejei. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Inphuumma kaom khachu chongkahoi khan ajar eya Zaatlop ngaikha Israel ngaile bateii in-esuom, khat-um Pathian in Christa Jisu diangnga chong inkhitna kha inchansuomma taksa inkhatbit insuungkhur in ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 1:26">Col 1:26</ref>,<ref loc="COL 1:27">27</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Ama ranakli chuontho nuoiya Pathian riangwai jarra inapeii kutchoi dungjuiya hiwa chongkahoi sik-ah kei suok ka-inchang. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Pathian ikadang mirakip karra aheknakhet ka-e innum, minkhidan kaboi inchongkhet Christa jarra zaatlop ngaidiang chongkaril sik-ah riangwai hichu keidiang inape kha eii, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Halli angrakip akabool Pathian diang akatheng khang rakip-ah alei inphuumma alei kaom, hiwa jarra mirakip diang inphuumma kaom kha angme tikha kaminthiar sik-um eii. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Ama imanuom khachu tuun koisuok diangnga inphut Pathian lungsing lungwar intei angjet kha marwaan ramma chuonkaroon waikaroon ngaidiang minjetnasik hi eii. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Hiwahi eini Pumi Christa Jisu diangnga inphut imintung hektik kaboi ama i-ngaidon dungjuiya itho kha eii. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Ama diangnga inphut khat-um amadiang ngamna jarra eini'n Pathian diang ngamna khat-um nilungdouwa luutmatorna nimu kha eii. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Kei'n nangni sikbit-ah kanapoongpi jarra nangni'n ningmalung minpoong maru; ajarchu nangni lurna sik eii.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa Naminriangna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Hiwa jarra kei'n Pa Pathian maikuungnga kemurkhup thep-ah chubei katho. <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />Ama makheiya marwaan khat-um nuoipil chungnga kaom insuungkhur rakip in inraming inroon. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Ama hektik kaboi lurna dungjuiya ama Ratha ah nangni suungnga ningratha ngarnasik kei'n Pathian diang kani. <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />Halli ngamna le inruoiya Christa in nangni malung suungnga omnasik khat-um inriang lamma arajung kasi khat-um kacheet-ah ningngir nasik-ah kei'n Pathian diang kananipi, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />khachu Pathian mi ngai rakiple inruoiya nangni'n Christa minriangna kha adung akhang, insaang inthuuk jetnasik-ah ranak ningnei nasik, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />khat-um jetna rakip neek-ah kakheel Christa minriangna kha ningjetnasik tichu Pathian sipna kha minkhidan omlekleiya nangni'n ningsipnasik kha eii.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Tuunchu eini nina emakli ni-ngaidon chungtiang ama ranak dungjuiya eini suungnga chuonkatho mator amadiang, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />koisuok ah khat-um Christa Jisu diang khang rakip-ah hektik kaboiya kalur kalian kha erase! Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Christa ah Taksa Inchun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Pumi sik-ah mikhumna ah kaom kei'n kanamasok, khachu nangni anakoina lamkhan aman kaomma ringru.<verse eid="EPH 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Kadai khat-um nunchan inchuol kha eru, malung kadai eru, kadei karaat e-inlang inkhatli inkhat inriangru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 3:12">Col 3:12</ref>,<ref loc="COL 3:13">13</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Ratha in inapeii malung inruolnakha kacheet-ah nida matornasik, katha khetkha tho-inlang kadaiya omsuomru. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Nangni nakoilai Pathian diang ngamna inkhatbit-ah inakoi angnga taksapum inkhat, Ratha inkhat, <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Pumi inkhat, ngamna inkhat, baptism inkhat, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Pathian inkhat om halli mi rakipngai pa ka-eii ama'n angrakip chungnga wai aroon, angrakip diang chuon atho, halli angrakip diang om.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Takkha kutchoi khachu eini inkhat inkhatdiang Christa imanuom dungjuiya inape kha ejei,<verse eid="EPH 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />khawa jarra hintia injia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Ama'n insaangtiang akal laikhan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">inkhumma inda ngaikha akatamtak ama'n aruoi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">halli mi ngaidiang ama'n kutchoi ngai aleipeii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Minpkla 68:18</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />“Ama'n akal lai” itihi ama'n nuoipil suungnga-um<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nuoipil suungnga tinahi nuoipil tina eii.</char></note> ileiluut tina eii khawa elekleiya ang tiname? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Angrakip diang asip nasik, nuoitiang kajuochum ama kha eii marwaan rakip chungtiang akakal kha-um. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Halli ama inapeii kutchoingai khachu, mi lekkhat in tirton, lekkhat in Pathian chongkachoi, lekkhat in Pathian chongkaril (evangelists), lekkhat in Pastor khat-um ocha ngaikha in-eii. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Hiwahi Pathian mi ngaikha christian chuonna Christa taksapum kha minlok nasik-ah itho kha eii. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Pathian sapa nijetna khat-um ningamna khan eini rakip heiwa suomnita inkhatbit nihong esik eii; Christa puitungna kha nitung phakhan eini'n puikatung mi ngai ni-esik eii. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Halli maleisei katho akadikmak chongkha kadik angnga chongriam kaminchu ngai chongril kha'n iwuongpui khat-um choinarei ichoi akadoong naipang kha enominjei. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Khawa rathuulla inriang ratha-ah akadik kha ril-inlang, alu ka-eii Christa diang ang rakip-ah ni-insoonsik eii.<verse eid="EPH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Ama diangnga inphut taksa saram rakip kha inchun khat-um injom, taksa saram rakip in inthosik chuonkha intho-ah taksa pumpui kha inriang lamtiang minsoon. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Col 2:19</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa diangnga Ringkhuo Kathar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Pumi ramingnga kei'n nangni diang ngartheiya chong kanati, khachu nemna kaboi ka-ngaidon zaatlop ngai angnga nangni'n ringkhai maru, <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />inmani malungchu kaziing in asip, Pathian ipeii ringna khan inchelmu ajarchu inmalung inminngar khat-um kamo kha in-eii. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Inmani diang injak tikha ommakjei, inpum kha taksa lamma inpeya halli kathamak nunchan kaboi chuon ngaikha kachi omlekleiya intho.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Christa jarra nangni'n ningjet khachu khawa ngaikha emak! <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Nangni'n ama jarra ningjetjei khat-um Jisu diang kaom akadik kha nangnidiang naminchu.<verse eid="EPH 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Nangni'n akamaruo mi kha mathaantru, ajarchu khawa akamaruo mi kha maleisei katho taksa manuomna khan minmangjei, <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 3:9">Col 3:9</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />khawa jarra ningmalung ningratha ngaikha minthar inlang,<verse eid="EPH 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />halli inthiang, akadik, nunchan katha khat-um Pathian ramilla inbool akathar mi kha inluktru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 3:10">Col 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 1:26">Inphut 1:26</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Maleisei rilkhai maru, mi rakip in akadik kha indiang inwaipui ngaidiang rilrasu, ajarchu eini rakip pum inkhat bit-ah kaom saram ngaikha ni-eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Zech 8:16</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Raangru takkha manu thomaru; ningraang kha kani minta maru, <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Minpkla 4:4</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />halli Seitan diang mun pemaru. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Inruup khan woikhat inruup thokhai marase, takkha kapoong karaalla kaom mi ngaidiang asan matornasik malung inthiangnga akut-ah chuon thorase. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Mi inmangsik chongkha ningmurra inphut suokmarase takkha insoonna sik arei dungjuiya mi ngai kasansik chongkha ningmur makheiya suokrase, ajarchu kara-ngai rakip in rawaan kamu in enasik eii. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Chongtanna nikhuoni sik-ah Pathian Ratha kha nangni chungnga jetnabi nadeeng kha ejei, khawa jarra Pathian Ratha Inthiang kha minnuor maru. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Chongril kakha, mikathat zoot, karaang, kakheekwou, chongse karil khat-um mi karilse ngaihi mathaanru.<verse eid="EPH 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Khawa rathuulla inkhatli inkhat insanru khat-um inriangru, Pathian in Christa diang ina-ngaidam angnga inkhatli inkhat inngaidamru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 3:13">Col 3:13</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Warra Karing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Iminriang sangai angnga, Pathian omchan kajui kha eru.<verse eid="EPH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Christa in eini inaminriang khat-um eini sik-ah Pathian diang arim kahoi sik-ah apumtak inpesuok-ah nanphalpi angnga, inriang lamma siru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Suok 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Minpkla 40:6</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Takkha zool-inthai halli inthiangmak emakli kara-ot iti ngaihi nangni suungnga araming-um rilmarasu, ajarchu inthiang Pathian mi ngaisik akatha kha emak. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Chongkase karil, ka-am chongril, khalook chong apha elekleiya akaril daru, takkha khawa rathuulla Pathian minpaakna chong rilru. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Inthiangnga jetru, zool-inthai, apum inthiangmak emakli mi ngaita kara-ot miring kha (ramil chubei katho mi kha eii) Christa khat-um Pathian rengram kha luuttheinuni.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Tuteii inkhat innum nangni kha nemna kaboi chong khan lamleiitiang nakeiruoi marasu, ajarchu hiwa ngai jarra chongkajuimak mi ngaidiang Pathian raangna kha kajuotungsik kha eii. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Khawa jarra inmani ngaile inchun suomma chuon thomaru. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Apha matiang akaziing khan ningleiom, takkha tuunchu Pumi diang warkha ning ejei; war sangai angnga siru, <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />ajarchu war<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">war; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscripts lekkhat achu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ratha tia injia.</char></note> kara khachu akatha, katuun khat-um akadik ngaihi in-eii, <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />halli Pumi malung tainasik ngaikha entokru. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Akara kaboi aziingna munna chuonkatho ngaile inchunmaru, khawa rathuulla inmani ngaikha malarru. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Ajarchu inmani ngai'n aziing na-ah intho chuon ngaikha rilsik um jakna om. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Takkha war khan jowar phakhan angrakip ngaikha inhong inlarjei, halli inmani nunchan ngaikha inthiangnga inlarjei. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Khawa jarra hin tia aril,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Akazaal nangni intheitru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">khat-um kathi makheiya ringtru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">halli Christa in nangni diang awarsik eii.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Khawa jarra singtheiya ringru. Ka-am emaru kasing kha eru.<verse eid="EPH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Apha kacha ningmuna rakip kasingnga inliing naru, ajarchu aphahi thakhaimakjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Col 4:5</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Khawa jarra amkhai maru, takkha Pumi lungdou kha jettru.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Halli ju inruimaru, ajarchu khawa khan napum aminmangsik eii; khawa rathuulla Ratha ah sipru.<verse eid="EPH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Ningmalung pumpuiya inpaak, minpaak laa, khat-um ratha laa kha karok-ah Pumi diang sak inlang inkhatli inkhat inkookru.<verse eid="EPH 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Pumi Jisu Christa ramingnga, ang rakip sik-ah Pa Pathian kha amun rakip-ah minpaakru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 3:16">Col 3:16</ref>,<ref loc="COL 3:17">17</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ompui Sangram jarra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Christa khoya nithole inruoiya inkhat in inkhat nuoiya omru.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Numei ngai Pumi nuoiya ningom angnga ningruothar ngai nuoiya omru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 3:18">Col 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Pet 3:1</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Ajarchu Christa in koisuok lu i-eii angnga aruothar khan anumei lu eii; halli Christa apumtak in ama taksa, koisuok kakatanpa eii. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Koisuok khan Christa nuoiya i-om angnga, nupuinu ngai'n ang rakip-ah inruothar nuoiya omrasu.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Christa in koisuok kha aminriang jarra aringkhuo ipeii angnga, pakhat ngai ningnumei ngaikha minriangru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 3:19">Col 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Pet 3:7</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Koisuok kha tuiya aminthiang suoli, Pathian diang pesik-ah chongnga ama'n aminthiangsik eii, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />khachu koisuok kha kapoiya, abi khat-um kazuur omlekleiya, takkha inthiang khat-um kachok omlekleiya amadiang apenasik eii. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Inruothar ngai'n innumei kha inpumtak inminriang angnga inminriangsik eii. Innumei kaminriang kha inpumtak kaminriang kha eii. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Tuteii um apum kaminriangmak mi ommu, takkha Christa in koisuok sik-ah itho angnga, eini'n nipum niwai khat-um katha-ah nibool, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />ajarchu eini ngaihi ama pumma kaom saram ngaikha ni-eii. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />“Hiwasik jarra pasal khan anu apa kha mathaanta halli anumei khale inchunsik eii, halli inmani inni kha pum khatbit in esik eii.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Hiwahi inphumma kaom akadik kha eii, takkha kei'n Christa li Koisuok jarra kiril kha eii. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Khale inruoiya nangni rakip in ningpumtak ningminriang angnga ningnumei kha minriangru, halli anumei khan aruothar kha khoya thorase.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Nuli Pa khat-um Sali Nai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Sali nai ngai, Pumi diang ningnu ningpa chongkha juiru, ajarchu hiwahi akadik kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 3:20">Col 3:20</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />“Ningnu ningpa kha khoya thoru” hiwahi chong inkhitnale inruoiya mansakhet chongpeii kha eii,<verse eid="EPH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />hiwahi “Nangni ringkhuo lamma akatha enasik khat-um nuoipil chungnga ringkhuo kasoot-ah ningring nasik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Suok 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Innidan 5:16</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Pa ngai ningsa ngai raangnasik chuon kha inmani diang thomaru, khawa rathuulla nunchan katha khat-um Pumi lamma minchu inlang minlokru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 3:21">Col 3:21</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Suok li Karu jarra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Suokngai nuoipil chuungnga ningkaru ngaikha Christa diang ningjuisik angnga ningmalung inthiangnga khoya ningthole inruoiya chiru.<verse eid="EPH 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Inmani ngai'n namu phakhan innaminriang nasik-ah chuon katha-ah nitho elekleiya, takkha Christa suok ngaikha e-inlang Pathian lungdou kha ningmalungnga wonrep inlang thoru. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Manmasi sepa emak, takkha Pumi sepa eii ti-inlang ningmalung pumpuiya thoru,<verse eid="EPH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />ajarchu suok um suok ka-emak um Pumi'n miring rakip diang intho chuon katha dungjuiya rawaan apesik eii tihi nangni'n ningjet. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 3:22-25">Col 3:22-25</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Karu ngai nasuok ngaikha in-angrip mit-enna en-inlang minchinasik chuonkatho emaru, ajarchu nangni khat-um inmani karu kha marwaanna om tihi nangni'n ningjet, halli ama'n iteii mimeel mimai enmak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 4:1">Col 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Innidan 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:25">Col 3:25</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Raalphur rakip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Ahekna-ah, Pumi diang khat-um ama ngarna ranak khan ngirru. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Seitan chuonheitho kathamak kha ningdei matornasik Pathian raalphur puondiar rakip kha inlukru. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Ajarchu eini indeipui hi taksa khat-um thisen kha emak, takkha waikaroon, intor, hiwa akaziing manmasituol ranak khat-um lairalak ah ratha kathamak ngai khale ni-indei kha eii. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Akathamak nikhuo kha heiwa kalla ningngir matornasik-ah, khat-um angrakip ningthosuoli ningngir tit-ah ningom nasik-ah Pathian raalphur puondiar rakip kha inluktru.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Akatuun kha kongkhit minchang inlang ngirru halli akadik kha phou minchang inlang inlukru, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 11:5">Isa 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />kahoi kadai ringna chongkahoi kha rilsik-ah insuukchak kha ningkekok min-eru, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa 52:7</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />apha rakip-ah ngamna kha phou min e-inlang choiru, khawa khan Kathamak Mipa meikakaang phelru kha ooksik eii.<verse eid="EPH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Sanminringna lukhu kha choiru, halli Ratha chem kha-um choiru, khawa kha Pathian chong kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Nisik rakip kha ang rakip-ah Ratha-ah Pathian diang niru, hiwahi ningmalungnga wonrep inlang inringchakru halli Pathian mi ngai rakip sik-ah Pathian nipicheiru. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Kei sik-um Pathian diang niru, khachu karil sik-ah kamur kamalongna rakip-ah kachi omlekleiya inphuumma kaleiom ringna chongkha karil matornasik-ah chongngai kha keidiang najuope kha erase, <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />ajarchu chongkahoi sik-ah kei inakadang taangwa kha ka eii, tuun mikhum na-ah kaom innum, kathosik ka-ekha kachi omlekleiya katho mator nasik Pathian diang nanipiru.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Insuona Chong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Nisuopui ka eii khat-um Pumi chuon kha huoikajouwa katho Tychicus in kei ang kalachangme emakli angme kitho tikha ningjet nasik-ah angrakip narilpijeite. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Chuon 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Tim 4:12</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Hiwa sik-ah Tychichus hi eini ang nilachangme khat-um nangni namasok nasik-ah kei'n nangni diang kiheitir kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 4:7">Col 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref></char><verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Kahoi kadai khat-um ngamna le inruoiya minriang kha Pa Pathian khat-um Pumi Jisu Christa diangnga inphut ule nai nangni chuungnga kajuotungkha erase. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Pumi Jisu Christa kha hektik kaboiya kaminriang miring rakip diang riangwai kha kajoutung erase.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>